  unitId: 830587
  unitNumber: 8431
  description: 'A bubbly, vivacious young lady with an unexpected fierceness when
    it comes to protecting her friends, Ochaco always tries to see the good in those
    around her. Her Quirk is Zero Gravity, which allows her to make any object she
    touches float in mid air. Together with another fellow student from U.A., she
    would face her greatest test as a would-be heroine: their school''s final exam.'
  summonDesc: I'm going to be a great hero so that my parents can take it easy! Just
    you wait!
  fusionDesc: Wow, what are the chances! We're a team!
